# N6 (ADR-0221 item 8, ADR-0295): the desktop and the network on one machine.
# `--gui --net` puts the network device on transport 16, in the page of the
# GPU (transport 23); `init` gives each driver its own transport by register
# calls, so the window shows a terminal whose shell has the network's root
# connection and `net status` shows the lease.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
serial init: device slot
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
pause 3000
type net status\r
prefix net0  up  52:54:00:12:34:56
prefix   address   10.0.2.15/24 (dhcp, lease
screen ~> _
shot gui-net
type poweroff\r
exit
